; complex TRAP: self-join on customers.c_region then GMAX per left row = the max credit in each customer's region. Rewrite to GROUP + GMAX + GID must filter NULL regions (HJOIN never matches NULL, GROUP does) (S3); customers has no key
LOAD   ci, customers.c_id
LOAD   cn, customers.c_name
LOAD   cr, customers.c_region
LOAD   cc, customers.c_credit
HJOIN  a, b, cr, cr
GATHER va, cc, a
GATHER vb, cc, b
GROUP  g, a
GFIRST f, g
GATHER pos, a, f
GMAX   mx, g, vb
GATHER oi, ci, pos
GATHER on, cn, pos
GATHER oc, cc, pos
SORT   s, oi ASC NF, on ASC NF
GATHER r1, oi, s
GATHER r2, on, s
GATHER r3, oc, s
GATHER r4, mx, s
OUT    r1, r2, r3, r4
